[{"title":"冬至上陵途中杂咏八首 其五","author":"边贡","text":"蜿蜿野田中，白鹭静如扫。\n停鞭问征客，云是居庸道。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18217,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬至上陵途中杂咏八首 其六","author":"边贡","text":"枯杨临大堤，上有鸲鹆窠。\n春风几日至，会使绿阴多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18218,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬至上陵途中杂咏八首 其七","author":"边贡","text":"山中风日暖，蔼蔼似初春。\n乱石牛羊径，时逢扫叶人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18219,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬至上陵途中杂咏八首 其八","author":"边贡","text":"月出东陵峰，照见西陵树。\n何事同心子，山中不相遇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18220,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同台峰熊侍御看花四首 其一","author":"边贡","text":"袅袅叶含雨，菲菲香近人。\n如何向阳蕊，开花向阳春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18221,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同台峰熊侍御看花四首 其二","author":"边贡","text":"秀色红翻坐，浓阴绿绕阶。\n觑花还拄杖，冲雨不怜鞋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18222,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同台峰熊侍御看花四首 其三","author":"边贡","text":"借问雨中好，何如晴后看。\n锦江红湿处，应记独凭阑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18223,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同台峰熊侍御看花四首 其四","author":"边贡","text":"室静客稀赏，地偏花更清。\n自开还自落，宛似野人情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18224,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题内兄子立扇头","author":"边贡","text":"斜日清源北，浮云岱岳东。\n故山归路好，不得与君同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18225,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄李显之","author":"边贡","text":"逆旅逢秋感倍深，美人何处坐鸣琴。\n南宫只隔西河水，一夜相思万里心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18226,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"集杜句赠胡三良医 其一","author":"边贡","text":"此身飘泊苦西东，未就丹砂愧葛洪。\n多病所须惟药物，知君才是济川功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18227,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"集杜句赠胡三良医 其二","author":"边贡","text":"卿到朝廷说老翁，秋来相顾尚飘蓬。\n钓竿欲拂珊瑚树，未掣鲸鱼碧海中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18228,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"集杜句赠胡三良医 其三","author":"边贡","text":"长开箧笥拟心神，巾拂香馀捣药尘。\n词翰升堂为君扫，已知仙客意相亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18229,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"集杜句赠胡三良医 其四","author":"边贡","text":"断肠分手各风烟，肺病几时朝日边。\n同辇随君侍君侧，自称臣是酒中仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18230,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日杂兴集杜句 其二","author":"边贡","text":"柴门空闭锁松筠，燕子衔泥两度新。\n不是尚书期不顾，故园犹得见残春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18231,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日杂兴集杜句 其三","author":"边贡","text":"未有涓埃荅圣朝，便应华发老渔樵。\n东流江水西飞燕，人事音书漫寂寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18232,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七月七日同侍御毛东塘渡河遇风","author":"边贡","text":"偶然同渡不同舟，风到扬帆共逆流。\n莫谓狂澜无砥柱，嵩行千古镇中州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18233,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迎銮曲二十首和刘希尹之作 其一","author":"边贡","text":"南幸三吴北幸幽，乾坤开辟两神州。\n文儒自守高皇训，武将谁分圣主忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18234,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迎銮曲二十首和刘希尹之作 其四","author":"边贡","text":"石头城如银虎盘，金陵山似玉龙蟠。\n休讶六军停跸久，本来江左是长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18235,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迎銮曲二十首和刘希尹之作 其八","author":"边贡","text":"羽盖霓旌晓出游，绀霞红日映江流。\n云中帝子三千阙，海上仙人十二楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18236,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迎銮曲二十首和刘希尹之作 其十","author":"边贡","text":"扬子江头驻六师，太平天子赏功时。\n红云影乱黄龙舰，白日光摇绣虎旗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18237,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迎銮曲二十首和刘希尹之作 其十二","author":"边贡","text":"江口传呼大驾临，顺流风雨注江心。\n风起半山群虎啸，雨来深水一龙吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18238,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迎銮曲二十首和刘希尹之作 其十三","author":"边贡","text":"大君仁圣迥非常，远似唐宗近宋皇。\n访道先过赵普宅，哀贤还吊魏徵丧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18239,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迎銮曲二十首和刘希尹之作 其十四","author":"边贡","text":"潮落江门烟水秋，云帆八月过扬州。\n两京驰道三千里，夹岸垂杨接御沟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18240,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迎銮曲二十首和刘希尹之作 其十五","author":"边贡","text":"翩翩龙马控雕戈，白日清秋沛上过。\n圣主守边思猛士，临风高咏大风歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18241,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迎銮曲二十首和刘希尹之作 其十八","author":"边贡","text":"叠鼓凝笳入禁中，似闻韶乐奏南风。\n通明殿敞秋云碧，阊阖楼开晓日红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18242,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"迎銮曲二十首和刘希尹之作 其十九","author":"边贡","text":"雪殿云墀列羽旄，天王开宴赏勋劳。\n封侯未赐将军印，归马先分战士袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18243,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯歌五首 其一","author":"边贡","text":"日射江流生紫氛，喧喧铙吹隔江闻。\n江头巨石高千尺，好勒元戎破贼勋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18244,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯歌五首 其二","author":"边贡","text":"帐前银甲映朱旄，帐外牙旗捲日高。\n白书红尘飞一骑，尚方新赐玉麟袍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18245,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯歌五首 其三","author":"边贡","text":"虎豹鲸鱼一夜擒，湖南湖北动欢心。\n论功宜并衡山峻，比德还同汉水深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18246,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯歌五首 其四","author":"边贡","text":"秋水沈沈漾列星，盘涡殷殷斗雷霆。\n扁舟昨夜巴陵过，风起犹闻战血腥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18247,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯歌五首 其五","author":"边贡","text":"凤仪兽舞尽来王，犬豕何知悖且狂。\n高垒固巢今不见，麻洋滩下水汤汤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18248,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日过西内团殿","author":"边贡","text":"御沟东畔古松盘，曾得先皇倚笑看。\n龙驭不归鸾吹杳，石廊圆殿镇秋寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18249,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云中曲二首 其一","author":"边贡","text":"六军歌舞健长征，五色云随九仞旌。\n传语单于休近塞，太平天子驻天城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18250,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云中曲二首 其二","author":"边贡","text":"万岁声欢四海闻，大同新策破戎勋。\n汉文可是勤边主，按辔閒过细柳营。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18251,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感事八首 其一","author":"边贡","text":"天山戎马本天骄，入贡能轻道路遥。\n底事内兵翻作乱，祸胎疑自武宗朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18252,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感事八首 其二","author":"边贡","text":"一自甘州杀宪臣，国家纲纪似秋尘。\n各边声势元相倚，缓急谁为死力人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18253,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感事八首 其三","author":"边贡","text":"代郡城中十万家，膏粱珠翠甚繁华。\n兵残火烈须臾事，女哭男啼亦可嗟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18254,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感事八首 其四","author":"边贡","text":"宣府云中五日程，朱门王子白衣行。\n回头却向西山哭，玉眷金昆知死生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18255,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感事八首 其五","author":"边贡","text":"诸将邀勋各逞能，边军反侧寝还兴。\n抚哺休誇桂元帅，绥来还有蔡中丞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18256,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感事八首 其六","author":"边贡","text":"紫荆西望白云山，腹里云中指顾间。\n好降丝纶促诸将，急操兵马备三关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18257,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感事八首 其七","author":"边贡","text":"城中金鼓昼逄逄，城上高悬首级双。\n二十四家同日死，自今休更说招降。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18258,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感事八首 其八","author":"边贡","text":"白日城门四不开，就中情状颇难猜。\n乘时早定安边计，只恐春深牧马来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18259,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词次陈以道韵","author":"边贡","text":"佳丽曾矜得宠先，后宫歌舞一当千。\n那知宠极能生妒，不是青娥误少年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18260,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次白岩韵甲申除夕五首 其一","author":"边贡","text":"前山云接后山烟，可道公归是偶然。\n霖雨出山知有日，入山亲纪甲申年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18261,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次白岩韵甲申除夕五首 其二","author":"边贡","text":"北窗閒卧读南华，出处吾生信有涯。\n五色晓云天子宅，一篱秋菊野人家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18262,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次白岩韵甲申除夕五首 其三","author":"边贡","text":"黑发勋名镜里看，紫宸章疏早辞官。\n閒心自爱商山曲，懒听人歌蜀道难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18263,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次白岩韵甲申除夕五首 其四","author":"边贡","text":"落落朝廷醉眼中，苦缘忧国愿年丰。\n老臣心事如工部，只有升沈迹未同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18264,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次白岩韵甲申除夕五首 其五","author":"边贡","text":"留公无计奈公何，外国中朝属望多。\n此日同为太行赋，几时重和庆云歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18265,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赵文昌中乙榜雨中感怀见遗走笔和荅 其一","author":"边贡","text":"华发王门晚拜官，齐竽声里独成叹。\n何人为荐长沙傅，一见文皇献治安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18266,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赵文昌中乙榜雨中感怀见遗走笔和荅 其二","author":"边贡","text":"十日春无一日晴，客堂沽酒莫辞倾。\n纸窗风信梨花雨，恼乱归心是此声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18267,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赵文昌中乙榜雨中感怀见遗走笔和荅 其三","author":"边贡","text":"撚断吟须字未安，短歌聊尔代长叹。\n春风座上无边景，漫道儒官是冷官。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18268,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赵文昌中乙榜雨中感怀见遗走笔和荅 其四","author":"边贡","text":"春归花落鸟无声，一夜閒愁带雨倾。\n自古浮云本无定，漫将消息问阴晴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18269,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荅滦江王中丞见怀之作","author":"边贡","text":"院台深处绿阴屯，松下棋枰竹下尊。\n苦忆去年欢赏地，碧天如水月当门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18270,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠北山周子二首 其一","author":"边贡","text":"宦接乡山事已稀，谪居犹得近王畿。\n劝君今夜且雄饮，明日出城风叶飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18271,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠北山周子二首 其二","author":"边贡","text":"华发青袍不染尘，宦程回复主恩新。\n县人争说中都宰，曾向云霄忤贵人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18272,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荅台峰侍御见候三首 其一","author":"边贡","text":"斜日照雨明霜台，红花白花相映开。\n野老爱花情太剧，不须招致也能来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18273,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荅台峰侍御见候三首 其二","author":"边贡","text":"葵花半红山雨来，不辞沾湿看花开。\n主人莫扫花前径，恐破青阴与绿苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18274,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荅台峰侍御见候三首 其三","author":"边贡","text":"一尊花底思悠然，落日空庭席屡前。\n酒熟共欢游此地，花开谁与坐明年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18275,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄姜廷辅","author":"边贡","text":"王升店前秋草生，秦皇台畔暮蝉鸣。\n海翁欲访无人识，何处孤舟短笛横。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18276,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡菊泉惠我丈菊走笔谢荅四首 其一","author":"边贡","text":"菊花元自菊泉分，见菊真如即对君。\n安得对君还见菊，短篱斜日坐秋薰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":18277,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡菊泉惠我丈菊走笔谢荅四首 其二","author":"边贡","text":"丈菊亭亭入座新，白花辉映白纶巾。\n生来自有凌云志，可是孤高不近人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","comm